1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,975
You've probably had a message go out that shouldn't have: an email sent before it

2
00:00:04,975 --> 00:00:07,773
was checked, a reply-all that couldn't be unsent.

3
00:00:07,773 --> 00:00:08,801
Hold that feeling.

4
00:00:08,801 --> 00:00:11,428
It's the entire design brief for this section.

5
00:00:11,428 --> 00:00:16,053
The last agent in this course chases the follow ups Priya would otherwise forget.

6
00:00:16,053 --> 00:00:20,507
It is also the one built around a single non-negotiable rule, and this section

7
00:00:20,507 --> 00:00:25,304
exists to show you exactly how that rule gets enforced in the build itself, not just

8
00:00:25,304 --> 00:00:27,017
promised in a job description.
